  dialogue:
  - 'Good morning trainees. How did you sleep? Good I hope. Are you hungry? We made
    some lunch for you. Come down to the dining area. '
  - TRAINING WILL BEGIN SOON.
  - To begin your training please make your way to the training rooms down the hall.
  - Each training room has been created to push you to the limit. You must use your
    unique arsenal of skills if you are to succeed. Good luck trainee, we will be
    watching...
